# HomiePG Root Environment Variables Template
#
# HomiePG is organized as an npm monorepo with multiple apps:
# - apps/backend: Express + Supabase API server
# - apps/marketing-website: Next.js public & tenant web portal
# - apps/admin-website: Next.js platform admin dashboard
# - apps/owner-app: React Native / Expo owner mobile app
# - apps/tenant-app: React Native / Expo tenant mobile app
#
# Each application contains its own `.env.example`.
# Copy the `.env.example` file in the corresponding app folder to `.env` (or `.env.local` for Next.js):
#
#   apps/backend/.env.example             -> apps/backend/.env
#   apps/marketing-website/.env.example   -> apps/marketing-website/.env.local
#   apps/admin-website/.env.example       -> apps/admin-website/.env.local
#   apps/owner-app/.env.example           -> apps/owner-app/.env
#   apps/tenant-app/.env.example          -> apps/tenant-app/.env
#
# Refer to the root README.md for full step-by-step setup instructions.

